msgctxt "L_TRA_009"
msgid "Locate alien tech medpack\\n"
msgstr "Localiser Medkit extraterrestre\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_010"
msgid "Rendezvous with CI spy\\n"
msgstr "Rencontrer l'espion de l'IC\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_011"
msgid "Revive Maian Bodyguard\\n"
msgstr "Réanimer Elvis avec le Medkit\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_012"
msgid "Locate secret hangar\\n"
msgstr "Localiser le hangar secret\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_013"
msgid "Escape from Area 51\\n"
msgstr "Quitter le Secteur 51\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_014"
msgid "Joanna - this is Jonathan. You're in grave danger.\\n"
msgstr "Joanna - Ici Jonathan. Vous êtes en grave danger.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_015"
msgid "They've flooded the area with nerve gas.\\n"
msgstr "Ils ont inondé cette zone avec du gaz empoisonné.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_016"
msgid "Get our friend to the containment lab. \\nThere's a hiding place there.\\n"
msgstr "Allez dans le labo où se trouve notre ami. \\nIl y a une cache.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_017"
msgid "I'll contact you when you get there - good luck!\\n"
msgstr "Je vous contacterai quand vous y serez! Bonne chance!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_018"
msgid "Good work, Jo. We need to meet up. They're \\ngetting suspicious of me.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Bon travail, Jo. Nous devons nous rejoindre. Ils \\ndeviennent méfiants.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_019"
msgid ""
"Use the maintenance hatch I've opened \\nin one of the containment labs. "
"Hurry.\\n"
msgstr "Passez par le conduit ouvert \\ndans un des labos. Dépêchez-vous.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_020"
msgid "Obtain alien medpack.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir Medkit extraterr.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_021"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries: \\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_022"
msgid "Alien medpack\\n"
msgstr "Medkit\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_023"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "L_TRA_024"
msgid "Picked up an alien medpack.\\n"
msgstr "Medkit extraterr. obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_025"
msgid "Joanna - over here.\\n"
msgstr "Joanna - par ici.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_026"
msgid "We need to get back to our friend.\\n"
msgstr "Nous devons retrouver notre ami.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_027"
msgid "Right, we're near. Cover me, Jo...\\n"
msgstr "Bien, nous y sommes presque. Couvrez-moi, Jo...\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_028"
msgid "Okay - stand back.\\n"
msgstr "Ok - Restez derrière.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_029"
msgid "Jonathan has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Jonathan a été tué.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_030"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Elvis a été tué.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_031"
msgid "The secret hangar has been located.\\n"
msgstr "Le hangar secret a été découvert.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_032"
msgid "Okay, Jo - let's go.\\n"
msgstr "Ok, Jo - allons-y.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_033"
msgid "Alien medpack activated.\\n"
msgstr "Medkit extraterr. activé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_034"
msgid "Alien medpack operation aborted.\\n"
msgstr "Opération Medkit annulée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_035"
msgid "Alien medpack has been administered.\\n"
msgstr "Medkit administré.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_036"
msgid "Mission critical object destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_037"
msgid "Outer hangar door is opening.\\n"
msgstr "Ouverture porte extérieure hangar.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_038"
msgid "Outer hangar door is closing.\\n"
msgstr "Fermeture porte extérieure hangar.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_039"
msgid "Inner hangar door is opening.\\n"
msgstr "Ouverture porte intérieure hangar.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_040"
msgid "Inner hangar door is closing.\\n"
msgstr "fermeture porte intérieure hangar.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_041"
msgid "It's the only way out of here.\\n"
msgstr "C'est la seule sortie possible.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_042"
msgid "You're the only one who can fly it, Elvis, so get in.\\n"
msgstr "Tu es le seul à pouvoir piloter, Elvis. Alors au boulot.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_043"
msgid "But we can't leave you behind.\\n"
msgstr "Mais nous ne pouvons pas te laisser derrière.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_044"
msgid "There must be a way out of here.\\n"
msgstr "Il doit y avoir une solution.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_045"
msgid "One of us will have to stay behind and open the \\nhangar doors.\\n"
msgstr "L'un de nous devra rester en arrière pour \\nouvrir le hangar.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_046"
msgid "I'll get out on that hoverbike. Cover me while I \\nopen the doors.\\n"
msgstr "Je vais prendre cette hoverbike. Couvrez-moi \\nj'ouvre les portes.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_047"
msgid "Jonathan, go with Elvis. I'll see to the consoles.\\n"
msgstr "Jonathan, allez avec Elvis. Je vais voir les consoles.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_048"
msgid "It's dangerous, Jo...\\n"
msgstr "C'est trop dangereux, Jo...\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_049"
msgid "I can handle it... Trust me.\\n"
msgstr "Je devrais m'en sortir... Aie confiance.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_050"
msgid "...Okay.\\n"
msgstr "...Ok.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_051"
msgid "Damn it, Joanna... cover me!\\n"
msgstr "Merde, Joanna... Couvrez-moi!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_052"
msgid "I'll cover the stairs - you take the ramp.\\n"
msgstr "Je vais bloquer les marches - Occupez-vous de la rampe.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_053"
msgid "The hangar doors are now open.\\n"
msgstr "Les portes du hangar sont ouvertes.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_054"
msgid "Medical containment doors unlocked.\\n"
msgstr "Les portes du bloc médical sont ouvertes.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_055"
msgid "The medpack's got to be somewhere around here.\\n"
msgstr "Le Medkit doit se trouver par-là.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_056"
msgid "Time to hook up with Jonathan, before he gets \\ninto any more trouble.\\n"
msgstr "Il faut rejoindre Jonathan, avant qu'il ne \\nsoit trop tard.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_057"
msgid "That smell... oil... I smelt that in the other \\nhangars.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Cette odeur... de l'huile... je l'ai sentie dans \\nles autres hangars.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_058"
msgid "The jetbike should get me out before they lock \\nthe base down.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Avec cette Jetbike je vais pouvoir m'enfuir \\navant la fermeture des "
"portes.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_059"
msgid "Oh, no! We have a problem. It's a single seater!\\n"
msgstr "Gros problème: c'est un monoplace!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_060"
msgid "Two can get in but no more.\\n"
msgstr "Deux peuvent y entrer, pas plus.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_061"
msgid "Plus, it's got no style, you know what I'm saying?\\n"
msgstr "Aucun style en plus, c'est déprimant.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_062"
msgid ""
"I'm not having this. That specimen is government property and should not "
"leave the base.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Ce spécimen est la propriété du gouvernement. Il ne doit pas quitter cette "
"base.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_063"
msgid ""
"Let's see how that overconfident thief deals with our gas defense system. "
"She'll think twice before messing with me again!\\n"
msgstr ""
"Voyons voir comment cette petite voleuse va s'en sortir avec les gaz. Elle y"
" repensera à deux fois avant de venir semer le bordel ici!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_064"
msgid "What's that noise? Can't be... Gas!\\n"
msgstr "C'est quoi ce bruit? Mais, mais... du gaz!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_065"
msgid "Noooo, that wasn't meant to happen!\\n"
msgstr "Ah non! C'est pas ça qui était prévu!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_066"
msgid "Please stop! I'm not supposed to die. She... Arggghhh!\\n"
msgstr "Non, arrêter! Je veux pas mourir. Elle... Arggghhh!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_067"
msgid "You idiot! We'd better get out of here.\\n"
msgstr "Pauvre idiot! Allons nous-en.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_068"
msgid "Gasps, chokes, and wheezes.\\n"
msgstr "Eternuements, toussotements, pleures.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_069"
msgid "***aahh...! aahaa...! aaaaahhh!  aha.  ahh.***\\n"
msgstr "***aahh...! aahaa...! aaaaahhh!  aha.  ahh.***\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_070"
msgid ""
"I'm alive. I thought I'd be chopped up like the others by now. You're from "
"the Institute, aren't you? I recognize you from before. You helped me. Thank"
" you.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Je suis vivant. Je pensais être mort comme les autres. Vous êtes de "
"l'Institut? Je vous reconnais. Vous m'avez aidé. Merci beaucoup.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_071"
msgid "You... You speak our language?\\n"
msgstr "Vous... Vous parlez notre langue?\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_072"
msgid "Watch her... she's sharp.\\n"
msgstr "Impressionnante déduction.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_073"
msgid "Earrggghh...eerggh...\\n"
msgstr "Nnnghhh... \\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_074"
msgid "What's wrong?\\n"
msgstr "Qu'avez-vous?\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_075"
msgid "I have a headache. And with a head this big, that's no joke.\\n"
msgstr ""
"J'ai mal au crâne. Chez nous c'est assez douloureux, nous avons une grosse "
"tête.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_076"
msgid ""
"Can you walk? We must leave before they get organized and hunt us down.\\n"
msgstr "Pouvez-vous marcher? Nous devons partir au plus vite.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_077"
msgid "I think so. What's your name?\\n"
msgstr "Je suis d'accord. Quel est votre nom?\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_078"
msgid "I'm Agent Dark. Or Joanna, if you prefer.\\n"
msgstr "Agent Dark, Joanna pour les intimes.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_079"
msgid "Well, Joanna, I'm Protector One. But you can call me... Elvis!\\n"
msgstr ""
"Très bien, Joanna, je suis Gardien Prime. Mais vous pouvez m'appeler... "
"Elvis!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_080"
msgid "Console is not active.\\n"
msgstr "La console est débranchée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_081"
msgid ""
"What the hell do you think you're doing? \\nThis is supposed to be a sealed "
"room! \\nDon't you know anything about autopsy \\nprocedures?\\n"
msgstr ""
"Mais, qu'est-ce que vous faites? \\nCette pièce est censée être scellée! "
"\\nVous ne connaissez pas les procédures \\nd'autopsie?\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_082"
msgid "Director Easton will hear about this, \\nyoung lady.\\n"
msgstr "Le Directeur Easton sera mis au courant, \\njeune fille.\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_083"
msgid ""
"You can't take that! It's government property! \\nThis is intolerable! "
"It's... it's... \\nunprofessional!!\\n"
msgstr ""
"Vous ne pouvez pas prendre ça! Ca appartient au \\nGouvernement! C'est "
"intolérable! C'est... c'est... \\ntotalement anti-professionnel !!\\n"

msgctxt "L_TRA_084"
msgid "I don't care much for procedures!\\n"
msgstr "Les procédures, c'est trop barbant pour moi!\\n"
